(text "C1 near pin 16; C2 near pin 8.\nRecommended additions." (at 19 159 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid 2865d013-4aaa-481e-97c8-4fc4553c85ef))
(text "ASSEMBLY NOTES\nY1-Y4: normally closed 5V DC valves, external loads.\nExternal valves connect to J2-J5. No LED resistors or external diodes.\nL293D includes clamp diodes. Coil voltage drop and chip heating need bench checks.\nPin 16 and Enable pins 1/9: +5V. Pin 8 only: external +5V_VALVES. Common GND.\nC1: 100nF near pin 16. C2: 100nF, rated >=10V, near pin 8.\nJ1 pin numbers describe this connector, not the physical UNO Q header." (at 82 137 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5822beba-b01a-4d4d-8c57-01f7bb21fe5d))
